B.Ug=new A.D("feature_illusions_smoke_and_mirrors","Smoke and Mirrors","When an enemy destroys one of your illusions, you or your allies adjacent to the illusions gain +1 to defense results until the start of their next turn. [Reaction] When you or your allies are adjacent to an illusion and are targeted by an attack, they can spend their reaction to force them to target the illusion instead.")
B.Yu=new A.D("feature_illusions_unnerving_movement","Unnerving Movement","While concentrating, at the start of any turn, spend your [Reaction] target 1 illusion and move it {Source} spaces then make a status check vs Int targeting enemies range {Source} of the illusion. On success, deal {Source d6} damage.")
B.ada=s([B.Wf,B.XV,B.Ug,B.Yu],t.U)
B.a0a=new A.ax("feature_illusions","Illusions","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int: On a Success, create up to {Source} spaces worth of illusions that last as long as you remain concentrating. Each space of illusions follows the wall rules from skills. You may create barriers instead of walls, creating 2 spaces of barrier for 1 space of wall. Your illusions are destroyed when hit by a single attack. You and your allies may move through your illusions causing them to be destroyed.\n\n[Reaction] At the Start of a turn, spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int. On Success, create up to {Source} Spaces worth of illusions.\n\nWhile concentrating, if you activate the ability, you may add new illusions to the concentration. ",B.R,B.ada,!1,B.eu,!0,null,null)
