B.a0Q=new A.ax("feature_justice","Justice","'[Action] Target an ally range 3 and make a Status Check vs Cha, On Success: Heal the target {Source d6}, and target an enemy range 1 from that ally and deal damage equal to the amount the ally was healed. Allies may not be healed over their max HP. Enemies are only damaged by the amount of HP the ally regains. This ability may deal 0 damage.\n\n[Reaction] After an ally fails a defense from an attack, spend your reaction, Deal {Half Source d6} damage to the attacking enemy and heal the target by the same amount. This happens after the attack is completed.",B.aF,B.ac6,!1,B.rh,!0,null,null)
