B.aDH=new A.bT("weapon_melee_Punch_Shield","Punch Shield",B.am,"On Success, Either, Gain {Source d6} Shield, or you may reduce your shield by up to {Source} to increase the damage done by twice the amount lost.","1","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Str")
